#: plugins/import/skrooge_import_backend/backends/org.kde.skrooge-import-backend-aqbanking.json
msgctxt "Name"
msgid "AqBanking backend"
msgstr "Motor de AqBanking"

#. +> trunk5
#: plugins/import/skrooge_import_backend/backends/org.kde.skrooge-import-backend-aqbanking.json
msgctxt "Description"
msgid ""
"An import backend for Skrooge using AqBanking.\n"
" You must install AqBanking (aqbanking-cli) and setup all accounts manually be"
"fore using this backend.\n"
"\n"
"At least AqBanking version 5.6.10 or later is required.\n"
"\n"
"This backend starts an AqBanking user-interactive session in the default termi"
"nal emulator.\n"
"If you experience issues please switch to the \"xterm\" terminal emulator by s"
"etting the parameters to:\n"
"aqbanking(--terminal-emulator '\"xterm -e\"') [Note: The single and double quo"
"tes are important!]\n"
"\n"
"For a list of all parameters please run \"skrooge-sabb.py bulkdownload --help"
"\"."
msgstr ""
"Un motor de importación para Skrooge que usa AqBanking.\n"
"Debe instalar AqBanking (aqbanking-cli) e configurar todas as contas manualmen"
"te antes de usar o motor.\n"
"\n"
"Necesita a versión 5.6.10 ou superior de AqBanking.\n"
"\n"
"O motor inicia unha sesión interactiva de AqBanking no emulador de terminal pr"
"edeterminado.\n"
"Se ten problemas, cambie o emulador de terminal a «xterm» con estes parámetros"
":\n"
"aqbanking(--terminal-emulator '\"xterm -e\"') [Nota: As comiñas simples e dupl"
"as son importantes!]\n"
"\n"
"Execute «skrooge-sabb.py bulkdownload --help» para consultar a lista de paráme"
"tros."

